  "updated_at": "2026-04-02",
  "bio": "Renzo Barquin is a master of traditional tattooing, having honed his craft since 2011 in the heart of Patagonia, Argentina. Their clients consistently laud Renzo's professionalism, which is evident in both the meticulous care they put into each design and the respect and attention they offer to everyone who enters their Trelew studio. Renzo's commitment to their art and clientele has made them a respected name in the tattoo community of Argentina.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Trelew, Chubut, Argentina",
  "tattooing_since": "2011"
}
